{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o054a","title":"有司奏三祖庙不毁及乐舞四庙递毁","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o054a-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"有司奏三祖庙不毁及乐舞四庙递毁","evidence":["mingdi-e-o054a-q"]},{"id":"mingdi-a-p045-disputes","label":"裴注·孙盛曰","text":"孙盛批评明帝未终而预制祖宗庙号，认为群司失正。","evidence":["mingdi-q-p045-disputes"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":237,"label":"景初元年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y237","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o052","basis":"景初元年"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o054a-q","mingdi-q-o052","mingdi-q-o059","mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o054a-q","source_order":[3,366,"O054a"],"order":914}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o054a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5e63d64ac994a91f9a8b","layer":"original","quote":"有司奏：武皇帝拨乱反正，为魏太祖；乐用武始之舞〖21〗。文皇帝应天受命，为魏高祖；乐用咸熙之舞。帝制作兴治〖22〗，为魏烈祖；乐用章（武）〔斌〕之舞。三祖之庙，万世不毁。其余四庙〖23〗，亲尽迭毁〖24〗，如周后稷、文、武庙祧之制〖25〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":365,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o052","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-26b7ecd6c3ecce777040","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年春（正）〔二〕月，壬辰〖1〗，山茌县言黄龙现〖2〗。﹝一﹞于是有司奏，以为魏得地统〖3〗，宜以建丑之月为正〖4〗。三月，定历改年为孟夏四月；﹝二﹞服色尚黄〖5〗；牺牲用白〖6〗；戎事乘黑首白马〖7〗，建大赤之旂〖8〗；朝会，建大白之旗。﹝三﹞改太和历曰景初历〖9〗：其春夏秋冬孟仲季月，虽与正岁不同〖10〗，至于郊祀、迎气、礿祠、蒸尝、巡狩、蒐田、分至启闭、班宣时令、中气早晚、敬授民事〖11〗，皆以正岁斗建为历数之序〖12〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":218,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-p045-disputes","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-36a41881bd5cfd47c7da","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞孙盛曰：“夫谥以表行，庙以存容，皆于既没然后著焉。所以原始要终，以示百世也。未有当年而逆制祖宗，未终而预自尊显。昔华、乐以厚殓致讥，周人以预凶违礼。魏之群司，于是乎失正。”","attribution":"裴注·孙盛曰","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":396,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a6b91005b45533aa0c4e","start":0,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
